Third-party components used by n2kd
===================================

The chartpack tool and the chart packs it builds have their own list: see chartpack/NOTICE.

nlohmann/json v3.12.0
  License: MIT (full text below and in nlohmann_json-LICENSE.MIT)
  Source: https://github.com/nlohmann/json (tag v3.12.0, file LICENSE.MIT)
  Used as a header-only library compiled into n2kd.

canboat PGN database (canboat.json)
  License: Apache-2.0 (full text in canboat-LICENSE)
  Source: https://github.com/canboat/canboat
  Distributed unmodified as usr/share/cheekymarine/canboat.json.

Catch2
  License: BSL-1.0
  Source: https://github.com/catchorg/Catch2
  Used only to build the unit tests. Not distributed in release tarballs.

GCC runtime libraries
  The aarch64 binary links libstdc++ and libgcc statically under the GCC Runtime Library Exception; glibc is always dynamic.

